<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61059" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠρίσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῡρί-ττω</span></b> , fut.
			-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίξω</span> (v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>butt with the horns</i>, like
			rams, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				769b20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>; of bulls, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ταῦρος δ᾽ ἔοικεν κυρίξειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				516a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἀλλήλους σιδηροῖς κέρασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					586b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόσχος κυρίττων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					4.692
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κυρίττων</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>), a logical puzzle, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.94
			</span></i>: metaph., of floating corpses <i>knocking against</i> the
			shore, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἰσχυρὰν χθόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					310
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
